<title>USA: NYS Empire State Development $32 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>NYS Empire State Development $32 mln repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities Inc said it repriced a $32 million New York State Empire State Development Corporation revenue bond offering, raising the coupon in 2017 to 6.00 percent from 5.75 percent.</p>
<p>EMPIRE STATE DEVELOPMENT CORPORATION</p>
<p>RE: $32,140,000*</p>
<p>NEW YORK STATE URBAN DEVELOPMENT CORPORATION</p>
<p>YOUTH FACILITIES REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>WE HAVE THE VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Baa1		  S&amp;P: BBB		   FITCH: A</p>
<p>DATED: 03/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 10/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 04/01</p>
